  "Description": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Have you ever wanted an army of constructs all your own, but found your skills not up to the task of creating a horde of golems? Well, do not despair! From the planes of Acheron to the front door of your fortress and/or dungeon, the mercenary maugs will serve anyone with the jink to pay them, and they do not bother talking back or asking \"Why do we need to burn this town to the ground?\"\n\nEach maug is a nine foot tall stone engine of destruction, and can be equipped to suit your own maniacal needs! So pick up a whole squad today!",
      "8": "Los maug son soldados infatigables que buscan batallas. Estos constructos sirven en los campos de batalla de todos los planos, como los perfectos mercenarios que son, ya que muestran una inquebrantable fidelidad a su señor, además de no saber qué es el miedo."
    }
  },
